{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-14",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "第一个回来看老师  (Visiting Professor Fang)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "fang": "方老师",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With unexpected time off from Xingtian, Bu Xiaogu returns to Media College to visit her mentor Professor Fang and ask about the classical text she saw on Chun Yuqiao's shelf. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，来来来，坐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "没想到啊，你是第一个回来看老师的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，没能够顺利毕业，很对不起您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "过去的事情不纠结，步步向前看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想请教您一些学问，可以吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "毕业回来修炼的有，但你是醒悟得最早的一个。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想请教一下您这本书。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "不问专业只问这个，倒像是我的学生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这本书的第一句话，道可道，有很多注解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是这句话到底是什么意思呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "这个呢，得沏壶茶慢慢地聊。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，来来来，坐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, come in, have a seat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "没想到啊，你是第一个回来看老师的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I never expected you would be the very first student to come back and visit me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，没能够顺利毕业，很对不起您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Professor Fang, I am truly sorry I could not graduate smoothly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "过去的事情不纠结，步步向前看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not dwell on what is past; look forward step by step.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想请教您一些学问，可以吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I would like to ask your guidance on some scholarship—may I?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "毕业回来修炼的有，但你是醒悟得最早的一个。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Other graduates come back to study further, yet you are the earliest to awaken.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想请教一下您这本书。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I would like to ask about this book of yours.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "不问专业只问这个，倒像是我的学生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Skipping trade technique to ask about philosophy—now you really sound like my student.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这本书的第一句话，道可道，有很多注解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The opening phrase of this book, Dao Ke Dao, has many commentaries.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是这句话到底是什么意思呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet what does this line actually mean at heart?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "这个呢，得沏壶茶慢慢地聊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For that, we ought to brew a pot of tea and talk it over slowly.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，来来来，坐。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "没想到啊，你是第一个回来看老师的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，没能够顺利毕业，很对不起您。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "过去的事情不纠结，步步向前看。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想请教您一些学问，可以吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "毕业回来修炼的有，但你是醒悟得最早的一个。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想请教一下您这本书。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "不问专业只问这个，倒像是我的学生。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这本书的第一句话，道可道，有很多注解。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是这句话到底是什么意思呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "这个呢，得沏壶茶慢慢地聊。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Professor Fang puts on a pot of tea to unpack the ancient riddle that links his classroom to Chun Yuqiao's thinking. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
